{
  "slug": "claudebase",
  "name": "Claudebase",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin that backs up and restores your complete Claude Code environment to a private GitHub repository.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `sync-config` (Use when the user wants to view or change claudebase settings like global sync, agent skills sync, auto-push,…), `sync-profiles` (Use when the user wants to list, create, switch, delete, compare, or inspect config sync profiles), `sync-pull` (Use when the user wants to restore, download, or pull their Claude Code config from GitHub onto this…), `sync-push` (Use when the user wants to back up, save, or push their current Claude Code config to GitHub), `sync-setup` (Use when the user wants to set up config sync for the first time, connect to GitHub, or…), `sync-status` (Use when the user wants to check what config has changed, see sync status, or compare local vs…)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claudebase@claude-community` from `rohithzr/claudebase`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "hook": 2
  },
